{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>A hundredfold, and He blessed him.</b> The meaning is that a measured thing has no blessing found in it (Bava Metzi'a 42a), and here it says that even though it was measured and the amount of a hundredfold was known, nevertheless <b>YHWH blessed him.</b> It further intends that the evil eye did not enter it despite the extraordinary abundance, for YHWH would ordain the blessing together with it."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:43:29.471943004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}